[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 904.55, "timestamp": "00:15:04", "text": "嗨，Jock”，而我這裡是晚上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 910.87, "timestamp": "00:15:10", "text": "機器人就會說“你好，Jock”，然後根據用戶所在時間自動回复，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 922.629, "timestamp": "00:15:22", "text": "類似這樣。但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 926.79, "timestamp": "00:15:26", "text": "現在這些功能都壞了，我得全部重做一次。那我還做了哪些工作？  薩米將永存。 [笑聲] 嘿，我分心了。好了，繼續工作。好的，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 929.445, "timestamp": "00:15:29", "text": "對不起。回去工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 931.269, "timestamp": "00:15:31", "text": "[笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 943.509, "timestamp": "00:15:43", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 946.31, "timestamp": "00:15:46", "text": "以前做過很多很酷的事情。基本上都是些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 949.43, "timestamp": "00:15:49", "text": "提升生活品質的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 952.23, "timestamp": "00:15:52", "text": "。  看來這件事還沒完成。我這就整理一下我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 956.79, "timestamp": "00:15:56", "text": "的羈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 959.43, "timestamp": "00:15:59", "text": "扣。"}]